# Customize Your 2-Module Frame Setup

Well done! You've selected a 2-module configuration for this frame, dividing the 0.5m x 0.5m x 0.5m unit into two equal sections for added variety and flexibility—perfect for mixing produce types (e.g., herbs in one and small fish in the other) with tailored AI optimization for each. 

Next we will walk you through setting up each module in turn.

